/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 92 0 R
/T (Education has really changed a lot in recent years. Now many schools, colleges and universities use learning platforms and Learning Management Systems to take classes, share study materials and manage assignments. When students use these platforms everything they do is being recorded at that platform, like attending classes, submitting assignments, taking quizzes or using learning resources. This generates a large amount of data that can help us understand how students learn and how they are doing in school.  One big problem with education is that some students stop attending classes, Some lose interest while others have problems with their school work, personal life or money. As a result they stop doing their school work. Eventually, they leave the course and teachers are not able to find out this until the student already becomes poor in studies. By that time it is too late to help that student. So it is really important to identify students who're likely to stop attending classes early on so we can give them the help they need  )
/E (Education has really changed a lot in recent years. Now many schools, colleges and universities use learning platforms and Learning Management Systems to take classes, share study materials and manage assignments. When students use these platforms everything they do is being recorded at that platform, like attending classes, submitting assignments, taking quizzes or using learning resources. This generates a large amount of data that can help us understand how students learn and how they are doing in school.  One big problem with education is that some students stop attending classes, Some lose interest while others have problems with their school work, personal life or money. As a result they stop doing their school work. Eventually, they leave the course and teachers are not able to find out this until the student already becomes poor in studies. By that time it is too late to help that student. So it is really important to identify students who're likely to stop attending classes early on so we can give them the help they need  )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
