117 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 93 0 R
/T (We have a lot of data now and this has led to the use of machine learning to predict student dropouts. Simple machine learning models like Logistic Regression, Decision Trees, Support Vector Machines and Random Forests are often used because they are easy to understand and use and they can quickly identify students who might be at risk.These models show that machine learning can really help schools find out which students need support.)
/E (We have a lot of data now and this has led to the use of machine learning to predict student dropouts. Simple machine learning models like Logistic Regression, Decision Trees, Support Vector Machines and Random Forests are often used because they are easy to understand and use and they can quickly identify students who might be at risk.These models show that machine learning can really help schools find out which students need support.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 93 0 R
/T (As time went on researchers started to look at how students behave and at the features of the data to make better predictions. Of just looking at age or grades they looked at how well students did academically how they behaved online and how engaged they were. This made the predictions better. The models still had problems. They did not work well with different datasets and this limited their use in different schools.)
/E (As time went on researchers started to look at how students behave and at the features of the data to make better predictions. Of just looking at age or grades they looked at how well students did academically how they behaved online and how engaged they were. This made the predictions better. The models still had problems. They did not work well with different datasets and this limited their use in different schools.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
