120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 93 0 R
/T (To make predictions better researchers started using learning. This means combining the predictions of models to get a more accurate result. Ensemble models are better at predicting dropouts because they can handle relationships between different variables.Tree-based ensemble models like Gradient Boosting and XGBoost are particularly good at this. They look at demographic and behavioral variables all together. When we combine learning with careful preparation of the data the predictions get even better. Ensemble models are more stable and reliable than models but they are also more complex. This makes it hard for teachers to understand how the predictions are made.So researchers are now looking at ways to make these models more explainable.)
/E (To make predictions better researchers started using learning. This means combining the predictions of models to get a more accurate result. Ensemble models are better at predicting dropouts because they can handle relationships between different variables.Tree-based ensemble models like Gradient Boosting and XGBoost are particularly good at this. They look at demographic and behavioral variables all together. When we combine learning with careful preparation of the data the predictions get even better. Ensemble models are more stable and reliable than models but they are also more complex. This makes it hard for teachers to understand how the predictions are made.So researchers are now looking at ways to make these models more explainable.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
