/P 93 0 R
/T (As the models get more complex it becomes more important to understand how they make predictions. Even if a model is very accurate schools need to know why it is making predictions so they can make good decisions. Explainable Artificial Intelligence is a way to do this.There are techniques like LIME and SHAP that help us understand models. LIME looks at how the model works for a student and SHAP looks at how each feature affects the prediction.)
/E (As the models get more complex it becomes more important to understand how they make predictions. Even if a model is very accurate schools need to know why it is making predictions so they can make good decisions. Explainable Artificial Intelligence is a way to do this.There are techniques like LIME and SHAP that help us understand models. LIME looks at how the model works for a student and SHAP looks at how each feature affects the prediction.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
