/T (The goal of the proposed methodology is to find out the students who are at risk of dropping out at an early stage by analysing their, academic performance, assessment records, registration history, and online learning behaviour. The complete workflow consists of six major stages: data collection, preprocessing, feature engineering, model development, performance evaluation, and model interpretation using Explainable Artificial Intelligence \(XAI\). The overall workflow of the proposed framework is illustrated in Figure 1.)
/E (The goal of the proposed methodology is to find out the students who are at risk of dropping out at an early stage by analysing their, academic performance, assessment records, registration history, and online learning behaviour. The complete workflow consists of six major stages: data collection, preprocessing, feature engineering, model development, performance evaluation, and model interpretation using Explainable Artificial Intelligence \(XAI\). The overall workflow of the proposed framework is illustrated in Figure 1.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
