/P 94 0 R
/T (A.DATASET DISCRIPTION:- We used the Open University Learning Analytics Dataset \(OULAD\), a publicly available dataset which is widely used in educational data mining and learning analytics research. The dataset contains detailed information about students enrolled in online courses, including, course registrations, assessment performance, Virtual Learning Environment \(VLE\) , and final academic outcomes. The combination of academic and behavioural information makes OULAD well suited for developing predictive models for early student dropout detection.)
/E (A.DATASET DISCRIPTION:- We used the Open University Learning Analytics Dataset \(OULAD\), a publicly available dataset which is widely used in educational data mining and learning analytics research. The dataset contains detailed information about students enrolled in online courses, including, course registrations, assessment performance, Virtual Learning Environment \(VLE\) , and final academic outcomes. The combination of academic and behavioural information makes OULAD well suited for developing predictive models for early student dropout detection.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
