/T (D.HYPERPARAMETER OPTIMISATION:- To make the ensemble models better at predicting things, we tried out settings for the models using something called GridSearchCV with 5-fold cross-validation. We looked at lots of combinations of settings for both Random Forest and XGBoost models. We picked the settings that made the models work the best.The main goal of this study is to find students who're at risk of dropping out early. So we used something called Recall to see how well the models were working when we were choosing which one to use. This way we could be sure that we were not missing students who were at risk. We wanted to make sure that we found as many of these students as possible. The Random Forest and XGBoost models were very helpful in this.)
/E (D.HYPERPARAMETER OPTIMISATION:- To make the ensemble models better at predicting things, we tried out settings for the models using something called GridSearchCV with 5-fold cross-validation. We looked at lots of combinations of settings for both Random Forest and XGBoost models. We picked the settings that made the models work the best.The main goal of this study is to find students who're at risk of dropping out early. So we used something called Recall to see how well the models were working when we were choosing which one to use. This way we could be sure that we were not missing students who were at risk. We wanted to make sure that we found as many of these students as possible. The Random Forest and XGBoost models were very helpful in this.)
