/Pg 13 0 R
/K [61]
>>
endobj
215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Our goal is to identify students who're at risk of dropping out so that we can provide them with timely academic support. To do this we need a model that's good at recalling students who are really at risk. The Tuned XGBoost model was the best at this with a recall of 89.72%.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [62]
>>
