244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (This study introduced a machine learning framework for predicting student dropout early by using the Open University Learning Analytics Dataset \(OULAD\). By combining information, assessment records, course registration details and Virtual Learning Environment \(VLE\) interaction data the framework collects both academic performance and learning behavior to find students who might stop their studies.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
