<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (To make the prediction process more clear SHapley Additive exPlanations \(SHAP\) were added to the model. The explainability analysis showed that features connected to student engagement and assessment performance like last_activity_day average_submission_day, total_weight average_score and active_days had the impact on predicting dropout. These findings help teachers understand not which students are at risk but also the main reasons behind the predictions.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (In total the framework offers prediction ability along with clear explanations making it a useful tool for educational institutions. By helping to spot students who might need help early and giving reasons, for the models predictions the framework can help with quick academic support that improves student retention and learning results.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
