548 0 obj
<<
/Title (Some studies have shown that looking at how students behave when they learn is better at predicting dropouts than looking at their age or grades. There are also datasets that help us compare how well different prediction models work.There is still a problem. Different studies use methods to prepare and analyze the data and they use different ways to evaluate the models. This means we do not always get the results.So researchers are looking for ways to predict dropouts using machine learning.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 322 0 R
/Next 601 0 R
>>
endobj
