/Title (We have a lot of data now and this has led to the use of machine learning to predict student dropouts. Simple machine learning models like Logistic Regression, Decision Trees, Support Vector Machines and Random Forests are often used because they are easy to understand and use and they can quickly identify students who might be at risk.These models show that machine learning can really help schools find out which students need support.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 601 0 R
/Next 667 0 R
>>
