705 0 obj
<<
/Title (5. Tuned Random Forest: We made the Random Forest model better by adjusting its settings. It helps the model to get better at predicting which students are at risk of dropping out. The Tuned Random Forest helps in making the generalised statement.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 703 0 R
/Next 709 0 R
>>
